{"server":"tw","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_03_end","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_03","title":"相約大巴扎","storyCode":"AS-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"f01ee17deea40f617fe82b4a63920e35d8dde01faec074e9cea59aee89008241","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"豐獲集會前，佩佩發現二等獎獎品正是要尋找的寶石，信心滿滿的她認為自己必將一舉拿下獎品。阿斯帕齊婭也認出集會的三等獎獎品正是自己家族的另一支金盃。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g4_ctizengarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，你蹲在草叢裡等我，不要出來，為了能白天帶你出來，我這幾天可是花了不少心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"草叢太矮了，我的耳朵會露在外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再趴低一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，那個姐姐在對草叢又搓又揉的耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"優雅的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，不要對別人指指點點，不禮貌。她一定是喝醉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行！還是能看見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個姐姐快栽進草叢裡了耶，我們要不要去拉一下她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"優雅的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，這時候應該假裝沒有看見，摔一跤不是什麼大事，被人看到才有損顏面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"優雅的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫灌節的節前祭祀盛典會在這裡舉辦，今日都是來報名的選手，比賽時要是不小心碰到，那就太尷尬了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米納特哈瑪儀有個小傳統，在漫灌節前，附近的居民們會帶來各種各樣珍奇沉入河中來祭祀河神，向祂祈求好運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜猜這座城市中最貴重的寶石在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這片河道中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡等等，我去弄一輛修剪灌木叢的小推車，你可以坐在收集落葉的大桶裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣推著你到河邊去沒人會發現的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定這樣行得通嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別扯我衣角，成熟一點，老古董！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲好，不要亂動！我馬上就回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵……喵嗷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……動物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（優雅地翹起尾巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡有很多雕像正是依著你的模樣刻繪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（得意地晃動尾巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個漂亮的傢伙，怪不得這裡的人會這樣喜愛你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（矜持地撅起臀部）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……你是想讓我摸摸你嗎？可是你離我有點遠，佩佩讓我留在這裡不要亂動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刻意地賣弄風情）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以走近一點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不悅地掃動尾巴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要生氣，或許我往前一點也不是不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，祖拜爾，不要趴著看小雲獸了，來看我找到了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你看起來怎麼不太高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我沒有不高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就快鑽進來吧，我特地量過，裝一個你綽綽有餘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡面……有點髒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"髒？只是一些落葉和一張廢紙而已啊，你可是被從滿是沙土的坑洞中挖出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請容我拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，讓我為你清理一下好了，落葉……倒出來，廢紙……就是張傳單嘛，也不髒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩從落葉桶裡翻出紙團，打開來。\n她的表情突然凝固了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豐獲集會……那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是本地節日慶典的一部分……人們需要在比賽中展示自己最珍貴的收藏，勝者可以獲得贊助人提供的獎品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些獎品，有很多都令我感到熟悉，尤其是二等獎，真是讓我懷念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然會懷念，祖拜爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那我現在還要鑽進桶裡去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不然呢？我都幫你清理乾淨了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g7_oldtown_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊的夢囈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……這邊……古屍總不會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那位女士終於醒了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——見鬼。還好是個夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想年紀輕輕就被死人纏上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不要亂扔水壺，女士，即使這是你自己的水壺，你也不能在自由使用它的時候損害他人的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不好意思，我還以為扔出去的是我的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的歉意我收到了。所以，早安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，早上？"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默中，娜仁圖亞打量了一下眼前散發著訓練有素的武者氣息的陌生人。\n然後，她緩緩地伸手摸向後腰，同時用餘光悄悄觀察四周。\n錢袋還繫在腰上，但武器帶已經空了。\n刀全部橫放在茶桌上，茶桌在這間陌生屋子的另一端。\n這間屋子很普通，但它坐落於一座連人孔蓋都鑲嵌著寶石的城市。\n娜仁圖亞知道，此地一切都價格不菲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，就是你救了我的命對吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太感謝了，大好人啊！等我從這房間裡出去，我立刻讓我手下的所有人都記住你的名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是指我晨跑順路帶回來的乾麵包與水果，這些食物是他人慷慨贈予，因此我認為它們不應該用價格來衡量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒問你這個。也不想知道為什麼我走在大街上就遇不到這種好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不不，你的意思是免費對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，日光照耀之下，誓言不可悔改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的這份好意我心領了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感覺還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我檢查了你的身體狀況，以我的運動康復知識來看，你應該沒有受重傷，但你昏迷了很長時間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，我是有一段時間忘記睡覺了，這下補回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，別擔心，你就當是……家族遺傳的惡習。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族遺傳……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有大礙就好。還有哪裡不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她下意識地摸了摸脖子。\n針孔已經癒合了，但漫長惡夢之前的記憶緩緩復甦。\n沒送到的通行證，失敗的綁架，恐怖的古屍，墜落時的失重感，模糊的風聲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那可是十樓欸，我還以為自己這麼摔下去，肯定不會再醒來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，要是死了是這種感覺，那真可怕！幸好你救了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們總說，死後只要名字還在被人傳頌，就相當於藉由這個名字留在世間得到了永生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果永生就是沒完沒了地做惡夢，被屍體追到黃沙盡頭……那我就得好好考慮，讓自己名揚整個薩爾貢究竟值不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從博物館高處跳下來……是因為你想名揚薩爾貢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們薩爾貢人對“名”這傳統的堅持還真是令人疑惑……我衷心為你難過。你遇到什麼不順心的事情了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠了一筆債，滿頭痛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我有個問題想問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救了我，我得報答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……你要不要做我的手下，加入我驚天動地的大事業？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想起來了，我從樓上掉下去時許了個願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在來看，你就是命運發給我的那個“可靠的手下”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。只要這樣能分擔你的壓力，讓你更有生的欲望，我樂意效勞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g5_museum"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿娜特！阿娜特！快來看我發現了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你發現了什麼我不知道，但是我發現你又帶著博物館內的重要文物跑出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還把他裝在一個髒兮兮的……落葉桶裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起嘛，那傢伙一直悶在博物館裡，我不忍心，所以帶他出去轉轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……是的，阿娜特女士，我也想四處看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧看吧。我們還是放過這些無謂的話題，然後聊聊我發現的好東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……一張皺巴巴的海報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上面的內容！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是每次節日慶典前常有的熱身活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這不就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和祖拜爾苦苦尋找多日的第三顆寶石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說看祖拜爾待在博物館太悶所以想要帶他四處看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便嘛……都是順便的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你有想好怎麼拿到這顆寶石嗎？二等獎也不是輕而易舉就能贏得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到豐獲集會的人非富即貴，帶來參加集會的珍奇更是數不勝數，僅我知道隱姓埋名來此觀光的帕夏就有兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有困難，我可以為你鑑定文物，或者貢獻我本人作為參賽的展品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，對我來說這些都不是難事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的問題在於，我要拿出什麼樣的物品才能贏得比賽二等獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它要價值非凡，卻不能獨一無二，它要體現一個時代的風貌，卻不能代表那個時代……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得正好拿個第二，才能把那顆“巨大而性質獨特、帶有沙阿時代印記的寶石”拿到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿第二……才是令人苦惱的地方啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想到了什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩沒有回答，只是半眯著眼睛看向天窗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"午時已過，陽光從圓形天窗傾瀉下來，在地板上投下一個橢圓光圈。\n站在光圈的中間，佩佩突然綻開一個明媚的笑容，隨後將手指伸出，指向窗外的圓日。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讚美你，哈拉赫特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用哈拉赫特的神像參賽？也是個不錯的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我只是為祂贈予的靈感而抒發感激之情，並非想要以與其相關的物品參加比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看祂投在地上的光圈，是不是很像一隻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你打算用雕刻著王者名字的護身符來參賽，王名框正是代表好運和免受邪惡侵擾的象徵。或許評審會欣賞這一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們到底在說什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這橢圓形的光圈最像的難道不是一隻黃金打造的拖鞋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拖鞋？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我就是要用一隻家傳的黃金拖鞋贏下那顆寶石！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g3_menatmainstreet_river"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想一直蹲在牆後面，我能和你一起進入會場嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別任性，你要吃的冰淇淋幫你買回來了，你真的能吃到味道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能……我只是好奇，那麼多人排長隊在買的到底是什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你的好奇心可以得到滿足了，快點吃吧，不然你的腦袋就要化在大太陽底下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我為原型製作的冰品……想不到我在這裡竟如此受歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有味道，冰冰涼涼的感覺總有吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不是感覺，準確點說，更像是一種衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一種想要跳進河中，讓水流沒過自己，好好暢遊一番的衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不就是一個平常夏日所應有的度過方式嗎？喔……對，黃金掉在水中是會沉下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才將它描述為衝動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是拿你沒辦法，你耐心點，等比賽結束，我晚上帶你去城中最大的人造湖泊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先走了喔……掰掰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉高斗篷）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"會場合唱團","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪河岸上搖曳著紙莎草，河面倒映著青金石♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"會場合唱團","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪流過黃金沙丘的長河啊，因寶石的供奉永不乾涸♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，先生，我聞到那人工合成的香豆素氣味，就知道是您來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錶告訴我，比賽還有半個小時才開始。真奇怪，不太符合你們新城區一向不肯提前到場的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珠光寶氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實是二十七分五十秒，我的錶走的還是更精確一些，畢竟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珠光寶氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的機芯和“過去與未來之王”發現掌控時間的聖物之後所研製的機械用了相近的結構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珠光寶氣的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對時間的觀念就和博物館裡的日晷一樣模糊，或許沒辦法意識到，提前到場等待的時間裡，沙漏中流走的可都是金幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著樸素的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我這塊老古董上一次校準，據說就是日晷從地下被挖出來的時候。不知當時您的祖輩在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是否應該提醒一下他們？現在是十一點二十五，他們都該校準一下錶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這塊運動腕錶的防塵防水功能很可靠，還能夠指南定位，我每個月都會戴著它爬一次赫里亞山，可以憑自己的親身經歷向他們推薦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別打擾他們，有這個時間不如再試試別的飲料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這個冰鎮芭樂汁比花草茶好喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，如果你喜歡，我再拿幾杯過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用不用，我又不是帕夏，我自己有手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，你真的沒有……輕生的念頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，隨便路過一個街心花園，竟然能遇到這麼多種免費的飲料隨便拿，我有什麼可輕生——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驕傲的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看，還是我這價值十萬第納爾的馱獸拉起載具跑得更快，這尾流都快把路上的人吹倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我則認為，跑得平穩更重要。這也是我名下養殖場飼養的特種馱獸的優勢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——*薩爾貢粗口*！我的杯子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就不必像您一樣，放下簾子遮擋濺起的沙子，或者路人翻倒的果汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人是來幹什麼的？沒看到這裡是免費喝飲料的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，我接住了。你喜歡的冰鎮芭樂汁一滴也沒有灑出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在路邊找個地方休息一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我承認，她的確是命運發給我的可靠手下，但……這不是顯得我不像老大了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我必須帶她認識一下阿雅吉和阿雅妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，你剛剛在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。我決定品嚐完這裡所有的飲料之後，去博物館看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也要去博物館？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。不過跟你不一樣，我對那些文物沒興趣，只是東西弄丟了，總得從最後一次見到它的地方找起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我的通訊終端這段時間一直沒響過嗎？沒有人聯絡過我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，博物館自從那次風波之後始終沒有開放，我也不認為博物館的管理方能夠像他們承諾的一樣，發現失物後立刻聯絡遊客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些天來，我每晚闔眼都會想起那天的景象。我既瞻仰了古代米諾斯遺落光輝的一角，也目睹了這座大博物館的混亂管理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他暫且不論，工作人員竟然連展廳的位置和遊覽預設路線都記不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還將幾十名驚慌的遊客引到沒有第二個出口的東北部……米諾斯展廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦見到館內的管理人員，我有責任向他們提出嚴厲的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，我改變主意了，今天還是不去博物館了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集會工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，二位女士，感謝你們這麼喜愛集會的清涼飲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集會工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你們在這裡逗留很久了，請問你們打算參加豐獲集會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"集會工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是豐獲集會的介紹手冊，二位似乎是遊客，可以透過手冊了解一下這個漫灌節前的重要活動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不參加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，阿斯帕齊婭……阿斯帕齊婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命運……終於垂青於我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜仁圖亞，你既然造訪過博物館，或許知道這是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不知道……這不就是一個杯子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我家族的金杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更準確地說，“另一個”金杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
